Directions for Top Sheet Submission

Into each exam assignment and problem set (EXAM 1A, EXAM 1B, etc.), please =
upload the top sheet (only) with your name on it, a zero in the total line =
(under "Expected Grade") and nothing else. One will need to open each assig=
nment separately and upload the top sheet of each exam and problem set as d=
irected. One will gain 1 point for each top sheet uploaded in this manner t=
o a maximum of 7 points (which will be recorded here) if you complete this =
by 11:59 PM on the due date.

One cannot upload these top sheets into this "assignment" as it is only a p=
laceholder for the miscellaneous points. Please upload into the individual =
assignments.

